>_ TOKENHOLIC   [HOME] BOARDS  MODELS  SOURCES  SETTINGS                                    scanned 4m ago · 3 to upload

╭─ KEYS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────╮ ╭─ READING THE NUMBERS ───────────────────────────────────╮
│ 1–5     switch view                                      │ │ $ EST   what the tokens would cost at API list prices.  │
│ tab     next view; shift+tab goes back                   │ │         It is an estimate, not what you paid.           │
│ p       change period                                    │ │ ≥1.2M   a lower bound: part of the usage was not        │
│ j / k   move the selection or scroll                     │ │         reported or has no price.                       │
│ d       show exact token categories on HOME              │ │ —       not available. It never means zero.             │
│ s       draft a post of your totals to share             │ │ PRICED  the share of tokens the estimate covers.        │
│ c       claim your spot: sign in with GitHub, when       │ ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
│         signed out                                       │
│ r       scan local usage again                           │
│ t       switch between the dark and light theme          │
│ ?       close help                                       │
│ q       quit                                             │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
1–5 views · p period · d detail · s share · j/k scroll · r refresh · ? help · q quit
